            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 20,
              "start": 20
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Chief Justice Roberts asked if references to equitable relief and restrain are clear enough to cover the Court\u2019s authority to grant a stay."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Kennedy",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "4ca0a58fa4da8a3b2c7de1cf7823f24e7e33796816a5ad875eb05a34c3e8740d",
