            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 21,
              "start": 21
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Kennedy asked what the major difference is between the standards for a preliminary injunction and a stay."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Kennedy",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "4ca0a58fa4da8a3b2c7de1cf7823f24e7e33796816a5ad875eb05a34c3e8740d",
            "evidence_ids": [
